                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2c4bcf22-7576-3f48-9552-d7b884338a3d",
                        "entry_id": "79dc5d2b-8c30-3387-aa7c-c64961c5e493",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Variante de Paléozoïque."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "662fd48c-f1e1-4cff-b3e2-cbdd4f8c6017",
                                "sense_id": "2c4bcf22-7576-3f48-9552-d7b884338a3d",
                                "text": "… ce terme doit rester si on ne ramène pas le paléozoïque jusqu'à ce qu'il comprenne tout le carbonifère et le dyas , c'est-à-dire la bonne moitié des strates de la terre, ce qui a amené forcément l'expression néozoique pour l'autre moitié ; …."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7caf1ea1-eca8-46b8-bd22-61c0f30fa946",
                        "source_entry_id": "79dc5d2b-8c30-3387-aa7c-c64961c5e493",
                        "source_sense_id": "2c4bcf22-7576-3f48-9552-d7b884338a3d",
                        "target_lang_word": "palaeozoic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3bbef137-0263-46d8-a1fe-9d08b9d82360",
                        "source_entry_id": "79dc5d2b-8c30-3387-aa7c-c64961c5e493",
                        "source_sense_id": "2c4bcf22-7576-3f48-9552-d7b884338a3d",
                        "target_lang_word": "paleozoico",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "paleozoico",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bab539ca-59d1-3b05-9b47-11073debecd9",
                                        "entry_id": "d3b7a753-f432-3368-937c-7c9a4166f9e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "dell'era primaria, compresa tra la neoproterozoica e la mesozoica, risalente tra circa 539 e 252 milioni di anni fa, contraddistinta dalla comparsa delle prime piante terrestri e dalla diversificazione e aumento della complessità degli animali."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "paleozoico",
                                "target_lang_code": "it",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02436487-ab75-3f1a-a9e4-e39ed0743d60",
                                        "entry_id": "9465f304-c7fa-320f-a6e5-437b6ddd15b8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "prima era geologica del Fanerozoico, compresa tra la neoproterozoica e la mesozoica, caratterizzata da sensibili cambiamenti geologici, climatici e dalla differenziazione della biomassa che passò da organismi sostanzialmente primitivi, vincolati ad ambienti acquatici, a vertebrati complessi e foreste di piante preistoriche che ricoprivano la terraferma."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4aa7d1b8-f12f-400b-b78e-4369e832f57d",
                                                "sense_id": "02436487-ab75-3f1a-a9e4-e39ed0743d60",
                                                "text": "il paleozoico si suddivide in sei periodi:cambriano, ordoviciano, siluriano, devoniano, carbonifero e permiano"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "a4683c90-3d1c-33d2-8a60-8e95697e1cf6",
                "word": "Paléozoïque",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c084d40f-b9d6-3541-b2d8-ec5130085444",
                        "entry_id": "a4683c90-3d1c-33d2-8a60-8e95697e1cf6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Première ère du Phanérozoïque, s’étendant de l’apparition des trilobites (-543 millions d’années) à l’extinction massive du Permien (-245 millions d’années)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d5b0b10-3db5-457b-adf2-2ce4295861e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4683c90-3d1c-33d2-8a60-8e95697e1cf6",
                        "source_sense_id": "c084d40f-b9d6-3541-b2d8-ec5130085444",
                        "target_lang_word": "Paläozoikum",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Paläozoikum",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c43ea2f-782e-3279-8958-658af96d4c07",
                                        "entry_id": "4c01305e-2fd1-3418-9f05-fe4a391265a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "älteste Ära des Äons Phanerozoikum, in dessen Gesteinsschichten erstmals mit freiem Auge erkennbare tierische Fossilien in großer Anzahl vorkommen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "813d32dc-1d28-45f1-9103-03055fd8ac0b",
                                                "sense_id": "6c43ea2f-782e-3279-8958-658af96d4c07",
                                                "text": "Das Paläozoikum begann vor 542 Millionen Jahren und endete vor 251 Millionen Jahren."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6571bf35-e315-4b63-bfb9-5f30f89a96ec",
                                                "sense_id": "6c43ea2f-782e-3279-8958-658af96d4c07",
                                                "text": "Die Namen von Erdzeitaltern enden gewöhnlich mit „-zoikum\": Proterozoikum ist die Zeit vor dem Leben, Paläozoikum das Erdaltertum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "867ef60c-c614-429e-b0d3-2e8f921d2058",
                                                "sense_id": "6c43ea2f-782e-3279-8958-658af96d4c07",
                                                "text": "Und alles endet dann bei Lebensbedingungen auf unserer Erde, wie sie im Paläozoikum herrschten - ungefähr zu der Zeit, als die ersten Pflanzen außerhalb des Meeres Wurzeln schlugen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f22a394f-83f7-40c8-9a1b-25f8a52fdf80",
                                                "sense_id": "6c43ea2f-782e-3279-8958-658af96d4c07",
                                                "text": "Diese sogenannten Anapsida lebten im späten Paläozoikum, etwa vor 325 Millionen Jahren."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "160d0d60-0495-4025-ae29-be7e77f71a9a",
                                                "sense_id": "6c43ea2f-782e-3279-8958-658af96d4c07",
                                                "text": "Die Sintflut ist da, das reinigende, alles verschlingende Wasser, das Böhmen versinken läßt — in einem Ozean, wie er das Land zuletzt im Paläozoikum bedeckt hat."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "923c9d46-3ec1-4147-8a73-7348388b24c1",
                        "source_entry_id": "a4683c90-3d1c-33d2-8a60-8e95697e1cf6",
                        "source_sense_id": "c084d40f-b9d6-3541-b2d8-ec5130085444",
                        "target_lang_word": "Paleozoic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Paleozoic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4034adf4-c705-3c05-bca7-977a0bf359d5",
                                        "entry_id": "f24056d6-894b-3286-8a4d-0f08bec4bf0b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a geologic era within the Phanerozoic eon that comprises the Cambrian, Ordovician, Silurian, Devonian, Carboniferous and Permian periods from about 542 to 250 million years ago, from the age of trilobites to that of reptiles."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ab91648-48f0-4a30-888d-67bbd1820dc5",
                                                "sense_id": "4034adf4-c705-3c05-bca7-977a0bf359d5",
                                                "text": "‘Itʼs all Paleozoic rock under our feet, this part of the world: to think of it, laid down five hundred million years before, shrugging its shoulders and bringing down the steeples on the churches!’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
